1
00:00:14,352 --> 00:00:19,580
Au revoir, Marinette. Enchanté.
Goodbye, Marinette. Nice to meet you.

2
00:00:19,680 --> 00:00:24,668
Au revoir, Adrien. Enchantée.
Goodbye, Adrien. Nice to meet you.

3
00:00:24,768 --> 00:00:28,436
C'était un plaisir de parler avec vous.
It was a pleasure talking with you.

4
00:00:28,536 --> 00:00:32,228
Merci, c'était un plaisir.
Thank you, it was a pleasure.

5
00:00:32,328 --> 00:00:35,636
Vous rentrez à la maison maintenant ?
Are you going home now?

6
00:00:35,736 --> 00:00:39,212
Oui, je rentre à la maison.
Yes, I’m going home.

7
00:00:39,312 --> 00:00:42,404
À bientôt, alors.
See you soon, then.

8
00:00:42,504 --> 00:00:45,668
À demain, peut-être.
See you tomorrow, maybe.

9
00:00:45,768 --> 00:00:49,316
Bonne journée, Marinette.
Have a nice day, Marinette.
